# Production build configuration — committed on purpose.
#
# Vite only inlines VITE_* vars that exist at build time. The local .env is gitignored,
# so without this file a fresh clone or CI build would fall back to the
# "http://localhost:8080" default in src/lib/api.ts and ship a broken bundle.
#
# This is a public API endpoint, not a secret. Never put credentials in this file —
# anything here is inlined into the client bundle and is publicly readable.
VITE_API_URL=https://orion-pos-api.ayushpalworkplace2006.workers.dev
